# The legacy dashboard (and its Supabase env) was retired by Slice 8 — the
# operator console lives at app.osppy.com (osppy-cockpit repo). NEVER put
# SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY (or any service-role / sb_secret_ key) in this
# app or its env; the CI guard fails the build if a service-role pattern
# appears in the source.

# The contact form (HQA-D175). The message becomes an email to hello@osppy.com through
# Resend's REST API; there is no database and nothing is stored here. Without this key the
# route answers 503 and the page tells the visitor to write to the address instead: the
# form never pretends to have delivered. Set it in the Vercel project (production), and
# verify osppy.com in Resend so CONTACTO_REMITENTE can send from the domain.
RESEND_API_KEY=
CONTACTO_REMITENTE="Osppy <sitio@osppy.com>"
